# Template for ~/.npmrc. script/bootstrap copies this to npm/npmrc.symlink
# (gitignored) and links that to ~/.npmrc. If a real ~/.npmrc already exists,
# bootstrap preserves it verbatim instead — your existing tokens survive.
#
# Replace the placeholder with the real token from your Mobiscroll account.
//npm.mobiscroll.com/:_authToken=${MOBISCROLL_TOKEN}
